      "l3": {
        "title": "The build decision — full context",
        "width": "wide",
        "sections": [
          { "id": "why", "heading": "Why local-first", "level": 1, "md": "The core question is **where the agents run**. Cloud-only is fastest to demo but ties the roadmap to *one vendor's* pricing and cadence.\n\n## Trade-offs\n\nLocal-first pays an abstraction cost once and keeps three things under our control:\n\n- Latency — sub-`60ms` on the owned GPU\n- Privacy — no transcript leaves the box\n- Cost — flat, not metered\n\n> Own the substrate once; every modality rides it for free.\n\nSee the [request lifecycle](#topic-runs) for how a call resolves:\n\n```\nedge -> intent -> broker -> action\n```" },
          { "id": "matrix", "heading": "The options at a glance", "level": 2, "figure": { "caption": "Decision matrix — Option B recommended.", "slide": { "archetype": "decision-matrix", "slots": { "eyebrow": { "num": "05", "text": "The build decision" }, "title": [{ "text": "Where the agents " }, { "text": "run", "accent": true }], "options": [ { "label": "Option A", "title": "Cloud-only", "lines": [{ "k": "Cost", "v": "Scales with use" }, { "k": "Latency", "v": "120–400 ms" }] }, { "label": "Option B · pick", "title": "Local-first", "recommended": true, "lines": [{ "k": "Cost", "v": "Flat, owned GPU" }, { "k": "Latency", "v": "18–60 ms" }] }, { "label": "Option C", "title": "Hybrid", "lines": [{ "k": "Cost", "v": "Mixed" }, { "k": "Latency", "v": "Variable" }] } ] } } } },
          { "id": "next", "heading": "What follows", "level": 2, "md": "Once the provider-agnostic core lands, adding a model is data, not code. The same substrate carries every modality.", "crossLinks": [{ "topicId": "runs", "label": "How the request lifecycle runs" }] }
        ]
      }
    },
